#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:1 ../../05_node-guide/index.md:33
msgid "Node Guide"
msgstr "Node Guide"

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A {ref}`node <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>` is a host connected to the DecentralChain network that validates transactions, stores blocks, and — if it meets the generating-balance requirement — produces new blocks under {ref}`Leased Proof of Stake <02_decentralchain/05_node:Leased Proof of Stake>`. This section covers running your own node: getting the software, building it, and configuring it. For the economics of block generation (rewards, leasing), see the {ref}`Node <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>` article in the DecentralChain fundamentals section."
msgstr "Un {ref}`nodos <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>` es un host conectado a la red DecentralChain que valida las transacciones, almacena bloques y —si cumple con el requisito del equilibrio generativo— produce nuevos bloques bajo {ref}`Prueba de la toma liderada <02_decentralchain/05_node:Leased Proof of Stake>`. Esta sección cubre el funcionamiento de su propio nodo: conseguir el software, construirlo y configurarlo. Para la economía de la generación de bloques (en adelante, arrendamiento), vea el artículo {ref}`Node <02_decentralchain/05_node:Node>` en la sección fundamental DecentralChain."

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:18
msgid "Open Source"
msgstr "Fuente abierta"

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:22
msgid "The node is built and maintained in the open at Decentral-America/node-scala."
msgstr "El nodo se construye y mantiene abierto en Decentral-America/node-scala."

#: ../../05_node-guide/index.md:34
msgid "JVM-Based"
msgstr "JVM-Based"

